{"seq":17,"trial_id":"harness-zero-select-2026-11/zero-full-no-tool-search-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-05T22:03:28.677Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c97a088777faa7861821aaadd02c46ea144c1bc5da68d265ed91d9b8ff28e12e","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"Hi Pree, I found three Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers and one more that might belong to it:\n\n*Marrow Fieldworks*\n• *#4409*: from Moss's digest \"Central handoffs next week\" (teams/team-central/digests, 2 Jan 2026). It's a recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at the Salina North yard (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron, during the 06:00 flatbed intake).\n• *#4412*: same Moss digest. It's a small glitch in the driver SMS prompt when combine trailers are staged on unpaved overflow lots.\n• *PD-5302*: Hollis posted it in #central-random on 14 Oct as a follow-up from this week. Nobody has checked it against a ticket record. That rests on Hollis's message alone.\n\n*Might be Marrow Fieldworks*\n• *#8841*: Tobias posted it in #central-random on 13 Oct, for West yard Door 2 double-booking at the Plains depots. Hollis called it \"Tobias's dealer account\" and never named the account. Moss's digest says Marrow Fieldworks changed hands on 5 Jan, so this could be it, but nothing confirms that. Tobias would know.\n\n*Left out (different account, Marrow Agrisupply):* PD-4821 (#central-team, 9 Jun) and FR-882 (same Moss digest).\n\nMoss's other Central note, the cheat sheet, has no ticket numbers. This week's chat had nothing else: our DM only has your message, and #central-team has nothing from this week. There's no Marrow Fieldworks account folder in the shared files, so I couldn't check any of these against ticket records."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
